{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"santizhu064-e-sr-ke-corpse","title":"恪尸以苇席裹身篾束腰投石子冈","accounts":[{"id":"santizhu064-a-77071c460a994660a360","label":"正文","text":"先是童谣芦苇单衣篾钩落于何相求成子閤（反语石子冈）；恪果以苇席裹其身而篾束其腰，投之于此冈","evidence":["santizhu064-q-5e6ef3b7ae3a3c62568d"]}],"participants":[{"person":"shaodi-p0041","role":"尸身被裹投石子冈","evidence":["santizhu064-q-5e6ef3b7ae3a3c62568d"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"原文纪年见引文；不换算公元年","precision":"undated","basis":"未由相邻段落推算纪年；原文时间表达保留在来源引句中。","evidence":["santizhu064-q-5e6ef3b7ae3a3c62568d"]},"ordering_evidence":"santizhu064-q-5e6ef3b7ae3a3c62568d","source_order":[64,291,0],"order":10974}],"persons":[{"id":"shaodi-p0041","name":"诸葛恪","facts":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"santizhu064-q-5e6ef3b7ae3a3c62568d","section":"chapter-064","block":"b-84c4de8591f60e77e601","layer":"original","quote":"先是，童谣曰：“诸葛恪，〔何弱弱！〕芦苇单衣篾钩落〖1〗。于何相求成子閤〖2〗。”成子閤者，反语石子冈也〖3〗。建业南有长陵，名曰石子冈，葬者依焉。钩落者，校饰革带，世谓之钩络带。恪果以苇席裹其身而篾束其腰，投之于此冈。﹝一﹞","section_title":"诸葛滕二孙濮阳传第十九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0135.xhtml","index":290,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":113,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
